OL,3,GNEWSAMariah Carey unveiled as latest
OL,4,Afestival headliner
OL,5,
OL,6,FR&B royalty Mariah Carey has been
OL,7,Funveiled as the latest headline act for
OL,8,Fnext summer's Blenheim Palace Festival.
OL,10,FBest known for her festive anthem All I
OL,11,FWant for Christmas Is You, the singer
OL,12,Fwill swap snow for sunshine at the
OL,13,FUnesco World Heritage site on 1 July
OL,14,F2027.
OL,16,FCarey, who is one of the
OL,17,Fhighest-selling female artists of all
OL,18,Ftime, will be supported at Blenheim
OL,19,FPalace, in Oxfordshire, by 90s girl
OL,20,Fband Eternal.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
