OL,3,GNEWSAMariah Carey unveiled as latest
OL,4,Afestival headliner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after country
OL,7,Fmusic legend Shania Twain and
OL,8,Fsinger-songwriters Alex Warren and
OL,9,FDavid Gray were announced as the other
OL,10,Fpalace headliners for next summer.
